<title>UK: M.A.I.D yr pretax loss widens, sees 97 profit.</title>
<headline>M.A.I.D yr pretax loss widens, sees 97 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.82 loss	    vs 4.42</p>
<p> Pretax		     7.03 loss	    vs 4.05</p>
<p> Turnover		   21.44		  vs 13.64</p>
<p>Full company name - M.A.I.D Plc. The electronics business information company said it expected to be profitable in 1997.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
